OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murder of woman who
OL,4,Afell from window
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied murdering a woman who
OL,7,Fdied after falling from a window in
OL,8,Fsouth-east London.
OL,10,FKerry Ann Goodbrand, 31, was found in
OL,11,FRowcross Street, Bermondsey, on the
OL,12,Fafternoon of Friday 21 August and
OL,13,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,15,FMohamed Sherif, 55, denied her murder
OL,16,Fwhen he appeared at the Old Bailey
OL,17,Fearlier. The court heard the window she
OL,18,Ffell from was in the defendant's flat.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
