OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murder of woman who
OL,4,Afell from window
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was remanded in custody by Judge
OL,7,FMark Dennis KC ahead of a three-week
OL,8,Ftrial due to begin in May 2027. A case
OL,9,Fmanagement hearing has been set for 5
OL,10,FFebruary.
